y-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed text-justify">We own and maintain a comprehensive fleet of advanced extrusion, printing, and cutting machines more than sufficient to handle large-scale orders efficiently and meet delivery deadlines with precision. This robust in-house capability allows us to ensure consistent quality, fast turnaround times, and flexible production schedules tailored to each client's requirements. Our team works closely across departments to ensure seamless communication from order placement to final delivery.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col space-y-6"><div class="space-y-2"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container text-primary rounded-full font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-widest font-bold"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary">verified</span>COMPANY OVERVIEW &amp; HERITAGE</div><h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary font-bold leading-tight">Your Reliable Plastic Packaging Partner</h2><div class="font-tech-data text-xs text-secondary font-medium tracking-wide uppercase">DSAM Plastic Packaging Manufacturing</div></div><div class="p-5 bg-surface-container-lowest border-l-4 border-primary rounded-r-xl shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-headline-sm text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">factory</span>Company Overview &amp; Heritage</div><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed text-justify">DSAM Plastic Packaging is one of the leading manufacturer of 100% recyclable, eco-friendly and oxo-biodegradable plastic bags and plastic packaging materials here in the South. We produce tear resistance, durable yet light (PE); low density and linear low density (LDPE and LLDPE); and malleable, rigid strength and corrosion resistant bags (HDPE). DSAM was established with the primary goal of providing the clients and business owners the best of plastic packaging product that they need when they need it.</p></div><div class="p-5 bg-surface-container-lowest border-l-4 border-primary rounded-r-xl shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-headline-sm text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">handshake</span>Our Commitment to Every Client</div><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed" style="text-align: justify;">We handle every order, big or small, with the same commitment to quality. Staying updated on customer needs, offering high-quality products, and being accessible are our greatest strengths. Our sales team keeps clients informed on production and delivery and is always ready to answer questions.</p></div><div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-border-technical"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6"><div><div class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary tracking-widest uppercase font-bold">LEADERSHIP &amp; EXPERTISE</div><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">EXPERT TEAM</h3></div><div class="font-tech-data text-tech-data text-secondary hidden sm:block uppercase">Plant Management</div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-border-technical rounded-xl shadow-xs flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-2 border-tertiary-fixed-dim p-1 mb-3 bg-surface-dark/5 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary font-headline-sm font-bold text-base tracking-wider">SM</div></div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-[15px] text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">MR. SONNY MATA</h4><div class="font-tech-data text-[12px] font-bold text-amber-600 mb-2">General Manager</div><p class="font-body-sm text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">20+ years of manufacturing &amp; business leadership, driving high-quality plastic packaging innovation and client excellence.</p></div><div class="p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-border-technical rounded-xl shadow-xs flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-2 border-tertiary-fixed-dim p-1 mb-3 bg-surface-dark/5 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary font-headline-sm font-bold text-base tracking-wider">AB</div></div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-[15px] text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">MR. ABUNJO BABON</h4><div class="font-tech-data text-[12px] font-bold text-amber-600 mb-2">Production Manager</div><p class="font-body-sm text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">45+ years of industry mastery since 1977; expert in raw material optimization, extrusion processes, and plant production.</p></div><div class="p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-border-technical rounded-xl shadow-xs flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-2 border-tertiary-fixed-dim p-1 mb-3 bg-surface-dark/5 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary font-headline-sm font-bold text-base tracking-wider">RC</div></div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-[15px] text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">MR. RECHIEJESON CANSAY</h4><div class="font-tech-data text-[12px] font-bold text-amber-600 mb-2">Production Supervisor</div><p class="font-body-sm text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">16+ years in plastic packaging supervision and machinery standards, ensuring precision fabrication and rigorous quality.</p></div><div class="p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-border-technical rounded-xl shadow-xs flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"><div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-2 border-tertiary-fixed-dim p-1 mb-3 bg-surface-dark/5 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary font-headline-sm font-bold text-base tracking-wider">RC</div></div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-[15px] text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">MS. RUTH CERILO</h4><div class="font-tech-data text-[12px] font-bold text-amber-600 mb-2">Marketing Manager</div><p class="font-body-sm text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">15+ years in packaging sales development, client solutions, and account management delivering tailored B2B service.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pt-10 border-t border-border-technical"><div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-2 mb-10"><span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary tracking-widest uppercase">GUIDING PRINCIPLES &amp; CULTURE</span><h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary font-bold">Vision, Mission &amp; Core Values</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">The corporate foundations that govern our production standards, client relationships, and social responsibility.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="p-6 bg-surface-dark rounded-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/10 text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px] text-tertiary-fixed">visibility</span></div><div class="font-tech-data text-tech-data font-bold text-on-tertiary-fixed bg-tertiary-fixed w-fit px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">OUR VISION</div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-primary font-bold tracking-tight">Leader in Packaging</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-subtle leading-relaxed text-justify">To be known as a leader in Plastic Packaging Manufacturing industry and to be the No. 1 choice when in comes to plastic products. We are committed to produce sound Quality Assurance in selection of plastic packaging products, thus, be an Excellent provider of Durable, Specialized, Affordable with Minimal Lead Time (DSAM) plastic packaging products while living up to our unwavering ethical values in carrying out our business as we grow.</p></div><div class="pt-4 mt-5 border-t border-white/10 font-tech-data text-[11px] text-tertiary-fixed font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-status-success">verified</span>NO. 1 CHOICE IN QUALITY &amp; VALUE</div></div><div class="p-6 bg-surface-dark rounded-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/10 text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px] text-tertiary-fixed">track_changes</span></div><div class="font-tech-data text-tech-data font-bold text-on-tertiary-fixed bg-tertiary-fixed w-fit px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">OUR MISSION</div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-primary font-bold tracking-tight">Compliance &amp; Partnership</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-subtle leading-relaxed text-justify">It is our mission to conduct our business in compliance with standard manufacturing procedures and guided by ethical business guidelines wherein Shareholder's, suppliers', clients', employees' and corporate social interest is of priority and main concern. We aim to build long term business relationship with our clients by meeting their satisfaction and exceeding their expectations in terms of product quality, cost and delivery.</p></div><div class="pt-4 mt-5 border-t border-white/10 font-tech-data text-[11px] text-tertiary-fixed font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-status-success">verified</span>ETHICAL MANUFACTURING STANDARDS</div></div><div class="p-6 bg-surface-dark rounded-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white/10 text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px] text-tertiary-fixed">verified_user</span></div><div class="font-tech-data text-tech-data font-bold text-on-tertiary-fixed bg-tertiary-fixed w-fit px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">OUR CORE VALUES</div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-primary font-bold tracking-tight">Guiding Principles</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-subtle leading-relaxed text-justify mb-3">DSAM is active on promoting its set of core values anchored to its company culture and history. These are the guiding principles of the Management and its Employees in the execution of their duties.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-2 gap-y-2 font-tech-data text-[11px] text-surface-bright pt-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Customer focused</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Optimum Quality</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Innovation</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Passion &amp; Excellence</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Accountability</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Integrity</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Teamwork</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Employee Growth</div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 col-span-full"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-status-success text-[14px]">check</span>Trust and Respect</div></div></div><div class="pt-4 mt-5 border-t border-white/10 font-tech-data text-[11px] text-tertiary-fixed font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-status-success">verified</span>ANCHORED TO COMPANY CULTURE</div></div></div></div></div></section>
